yle=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Caban\u00e3o Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o (Caban\u00e3o Trail 3.0) realiza-se no dia 31 de Janeiro de 2027 (Domingo), em Portomar, no concelho de Mira, distrito de Coimbra.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e dist\u00e2ncias do Caban\u00e3o Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa oficial do Caban\u00e3o Trail 3.0 integra tr\u00eas segmentos: Trail Sprint, Mini Trail e uma Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">J\u00e1 est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis o regulamento oficial, hor\u00e1rios e pre\u00e7os de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A data de 31 de Janeiro de 2027 e as tr\u00eas provas (Trail Sprint, Mini Trail e Caminhada) j\u00e1 s\u00e3o oficiais. O regulamento definitivo com as quilometragens exatas, hor\u00e1rios de partida e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o ser\u00e1 publicado aquando da abertura das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como e onde posso efetuar a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem exclusivamente online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma de cronometragem acess\u00edvel pelos bot\u00f5es de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o desta p\u00e1gina.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Clube Domus Nostra, sediado em Portomar, Mira.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Caban\u00e3o Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Portomar, Mira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Caban\u00e3o Trail 2027 (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se a 31 de janeiro em Portomar, Mira. Provas de Trail Sprint, Mini Trail e Caminhada. Consulta o guia e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Cabanao-Trail-26-Cartaz.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/cabanao-trail-2027\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Clube Domus Nostra\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Caban\u00e3o Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o (Caban\u00e3o Trail 3.0) realiza-se no dia 31 de Janeiro de 2027 (Domingo), em Portomar, no concelho de Mira, distrito de Coimbra.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as provas e dist\u00e2ncias do Caban\u00e3o Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa oficial do Caban\u00e3o Trail 3.0 integra tr\u00eas segmentos: Trail Sprint, Mini Trail e uma Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva.\"}}, {\"@type\